MID_SV_Serve_Noc_m01_01: Service lets you take a break from fighting.
MID_SV_Serve_Noc_m01_02: Give me a job, and I'll do it.
MID_SV_Serve_Noc_m01_03: I'll be diligent. This is for a god, after all.
MID_SV_Serve_Noc_m01_04: Compared to what I had to do for my tribe, this\nis easy.
MID_SV_Serve_Noc_m01_05: I know how to get right to it.
MID_SV_Serve_Noc_m01_06: What's up next?
MID_SV_Serve_Sop_m01_01: The gods deserve only my best.
MID_SV_Serve_Sop_m01_02: I can't be sloppy. I work for the temples.
MID_SV_Serve_Sop_m01_03: Quick as a wink! That's how I do it!
MID_SV_Serve_Sop_m01_04: Quiet, grumbling tummy. I've got to...finish this...
MID_SV_Serve_Sop_m01_05: The harder you work, the tastier your next meal.
MID_SV_Serve_Sop_m01_06: Food here... Food there... Food everywhere...
MID_SV_Serve_Cat_m01_01: If I am diligent enough, perhaps the vulkans will\nrecruit me.
MID_SV_Serve_Cat_m01_02: I will show you the definition of distinction.
MID_SV_Serve_Cat_m01_03: Take heed as I deliver sterling results.
MID_SV_Serve_Cat_m01_04: Perhaps I might meet a handsome priest with\ngood standing...
MID_SV_Serve_Cat_m01_05: Beyond reproach! Hohohoho!
MID_SV_Serve_Cat_m01_06: Had I been alone, it would be just as flawless.
MID_SV_Serve_Ned_m01_01: This will also hone my skill.
MID_SV_Serve_Ned_m01_02: Temples are new to me.
MID_SV_Serve_Ned_m01_03: I will devote myself to the task.
MID_SV_Serve_Ned_m01_04: I am happy to contribute.
MID_SV_Serve_Ned_m01_05: This is no difficulty.
MID_SV_Serve_Ned_m01_06: Find something to drive you even in the mundane.
MID_SV_Serve_Zac_m01_01: I'll keep a lookout for valuables...
MID_SV_Serve_Zac_m01_02: Kinda stuffy around here. I don't like it...
MID_SV_Serve_Zac_m01_03: What a pain. Let's do this quick.
MID_SV_Serve_Zac_m01_04: Temples give me the creeps.
MID_SV_Serve_Zac_m01_05: *sigh* I hate these stupid tasks.
MID_SV_Serve_Zac_m01_06: Gotta kiss up to the temples... Always looks good.
MID_SV_Serve_Maj_m01_01: I got this. I'll show you!
MID_SV_Serve_Maj_m01_02: Service, huh... Sounds like a scam.
MID_SV_Serve_Maj_m01_03: That all you need? Leave it to the great Majide.
MID_SV_Serve_Maj_m01_04: Wish somebody'd serve me for a change.
MID_SV_Serve_Maj_m01_05: I'm bored... Let's get this over with.
MID_SV_Serve_Maj_m01_06: Never been a fan of the temples.
MID_SV_Serve_Ven_m01_01: Eeeasy does it. That's the trick.
MID_SV_Serve_Ven_m01_02: Puts the fear in you, working at the feet of a god.
MID_SV_Serve_Ven_m01_03: Slow and steady wins the race.
MID_SV_Serve_Ven_m01_04: Hope I don't run into any familiar faces...
MID_SV_Serve_Ven_m01_05: I used to serve the temples, you know.
MID_SV_Serve_Ven_m01_06: Tasks like these used to be a cinch. Not anymore.
MID_SV_Serve_Ini_m01_01: It's important to always give your all.
MID_SV_Serve_Ini_m01_02: Must be careful to do a good job.
MID_SV_Serve_Ini_m01_03: Let's do this properly.
MID_SV_Serve_Ini_m01_04: I wonder what the god of this temple looks like.
MID_SV_Serve_Ini_m01_05: Whew. This is hard work.
MID_SV_Serve_Ini_m01_06: Keeping focus like this is tiring.
MID_SV_Serve_Jas_m01_01: Easy peasy.
MID_SV_Serve_Jas_m01_02: Thing about work is...you've got to get it done.
MID_SV_Serve_Jas_m01_03: Good time to think through your problems.
MID_SV_Serve_Jas_m01_04: I don't slack.
MID_SV_Serve_Jas_m01_05: Experiences like this are useful.
MID_SV_Serve_Jas_m01_06: Ah well. Let's just get it over and done.
MID_SV_Serve_Ale_m01_01: Work calmly and steadily. That's advice you can use\nfor any kind of work.
MID_SV_Serve_Ale_m01_02: I need to be extra careful.
MID_SV_Serve_Ale_m01_03: This work honors the gods.
MID_SV_Serve_Ale_m01_04: Every time I serve, my faith is honed.
MID_SV_Serve_Ale_m01_05: I'll pay attention to the little details!
MID_SV_Serve_Ale_m01_06: I'm confident in my dedication.
MID_SV_Serve_Cle_m01_01: 
MID_SV_Serve_Cle_m01_02: 
MID_SV_Serve_Cle_m01_03: 
MID_SV_Serve_Cle_m01_04: 
MID_SV_Serve_Cle_m01_05: 
MID_SV_Serve_Cle_m01_06: 
MID_SV_Serve_Mys_m01_01: 
MID_SV_Serve_Mys_m01_02: 
MID_SV_Serve_Mys_m01_03: 
MID_SV_Serve_Mys_m01_04: 
MID_SV_Serve_Mys_m01_05: 
MID_SV_Serve_Mys_m01_06: 
MID_SV_Serve_Nat_m01_01: Let's get this done.
MID_SV_Serve_Nat_m01_02: Might as well start right here.
MID_SV_Serve_Nat_m01_03: I better be careful. Lots of fragile things here.
MID_SV_Serve_Nat_m01_04: They must need somebody handy.
MID_SV_Serve_Nat_m01_05: I'll focus and get it done.
MID_SV_Serve_Nat_m01_06: I'll work hard—for the pride of Arago.
MID_SV_Serve_Hri_m01_01: It'll get done. Count on it.
MID_SV_Serve_Hri_m01_02: Even simple tasks require careful attention.
MID_SV_Serve_Hri_m01_03: Plan first, do the work, no regrets.
MID_SV_Serve_Hri_m01_04: I'll do it right.
MID_SV_Serve_Hri_m01_05: I'd like to get to know the ladies of the temple...
MID_SV_Serve_Hri_m01_06: Here's a good place to start.
MID_SV_Serve_Tro_m01_01: Right—let's get started, shall we?
MID_SV_Serve_Tro_m01_02: Good work is in the fine details.
MID_SV_Serve_Tro_m01_03: I can't help but feel tense around the temples.
MID_SV_Serve_Tro_m01_04: This is all old hat to me.
MID_SV_Serve_Tro_m01_05: Work like this will tire you out quick.
MID_SV_Serve_Tro_m01_06: Nobody wants to see a rushed job.
MID_SV_Serve_Cen_m01_01: I'll do my solemn duty, as always.
MID_SV_Serve_Cen_m01_02: I'll dedicate my all to accomplishing this task.
MID_SV_Serve_Cen_m01_03: Care must be taken not to depart from propriety.
MID_SV_Serve_Cen_m01_04: My work must be exemplary.
MID_SV_Serve_Cen_m01_05: Hard work renews one's reverence for the divine.
MID_SV_Serve_Cen_m01_06: I find exacting service refreshing.
MID_SV_Serve_Asw_m01_01: I mustn't make mistakes.
MID_SV_Serve_Asw_m01_02: I'll do this properly, according to the gods' will.
MID_SV_Serve_Asw_m01_03: May all find peace and sustenance...
MID_SV_Serve_Asw_m01_04: I will perform as is worthy of my rank.
MID_SV_Serve_Asw_m01_05: This is trickier than I thought...
MID_SV_Serve_Asw_m01_06: Let's get as close as we can to perfection.
MID_SV_Serve_Kou_m01_01: Maybe this will help to make amends...
MID_SV_Serve_Kou_m01_02: If this is what it takes...
MID_SV_Serve_Kou_m01_03: I have some idea of how to do this.
MID_SV_Serve_Kou_m01_04: I can't let my mind wander. It's time to focus.
MID_SV_Serve_Kou_m01_05: When I'm given a task, I carry it out to the letter.
MID_SV_Serve_Kou_m01_06: What would Britannis say if he could see me now?
MID_SV_Serve_Nuz_m01_01: I must take care not to incur this god's wrath.
MID_SV_Serve_Nuz_m01_02: I will carry out my role.
MID_SV_Serve_Nuz_m01_03: I bring rigor to all my tasks.
MID_SV_Serve_Nuz_m01_04: There must be no flaw in my work.
MID_SV_Serve_Nuz_m01_05: This work is hardly a burden to me.
MID_SV_Serve_Nuz_m01_06: Our duty is not so arduous.
MID_SV_Serve_Kir_m01_01: I'm tryin' to keep a low profile, here...
MID_SV_Serve_Kir_m01_02: No choice but to get it done.
MID_SV_Serve_Kir_m01_03: I'd rather do it right than get an earful later.
MID_SV_Serve_Kir_m01_04: Ghosts can't get you while you're doing good...
MID_SV_Serve_Kir_m01_05: Maybe helping the temple will keep the ghosts\noff me?
MID_SV_Serve_Kir_m01_06: Rather be swabbin' the deck...
MID_SV_Serve_Anh_Hal_m01_01: Halvin...you don't need to hover like this. I can\nmanage fine on my own.
MID_SV_Serve_Anh_Hal_m01_02: Oh, no, no, it's the other way around. I'm trying to\nwatch how you do it because you're so good!
MID_SV_Serve_Anh_Fab_m01_01: I am impressed by your diligence. Do you find\ncomfort in this work, perhaps?
MID_SV_Serve_Anh_Fab_m01_02: As my master taught me, "Speed is not as important\nas precision." It's the surest way to finish a task.
MID_SV_Serve_Urs_Lou_m01_01: I'm grateful we could do this together, Ludia.\nHaving you here has made all the difference.
MID_SV_Serve_Urs_Lou_m01_02: Really? Thanks, Ursula! You really know how to\ninspire a girl, huh.
MID_SV_Serve_Hur_Pep_m01_01: It's a pleasure to work with you, Lady Ultand. We\nwould do this daily and gladly!
MID_SV_Serve_Hur_Pep_m01_02: Hehe. I'm happy to hear that, but if we did this\nevery day, I think your friends might complain.
MID_SV_Serve_Esm_Die_m01_01: How sloppy can you get? OK, fine... Just do it\nlike I'm doing it.
MID_SV_Serve_Esm_Die_m01_02: Fine. You take the lead. Let's just get this done.
MID_SV_Serve_Esm_Mic_m01_01: We need to take this seriously. We can't just shirk\na responsibility after taking it on, so let's do our part.
MID_SV_Serve_Esm_Mic_m01_02: You sound like a priest! In a good way, I mean. I'm\nready to go! Let's do this!
MID_SV_Serve_Orh_Set_m01_01: I shouldn't chitchat while we're working. But I do\nso enjoy your company.
MID_SV_Serve_Orh_Set_m01_02: It's perfectly fine. I enjoy a good chat while getting\nwork done.
MID_SV_Serve_Kai0_Pet0_m01_01: Let's wrap this up and go fishing. Got a feeling some\nlunkers are waiting for us out there.
MID_SV_Serve_Kai0_Pet0_m01_02: I'll leave that to you. We'll serve a good feast tonight!
MID_SV_Serve_Cle_Mys_m01_01: Making us work in this dung heap... It's a bad joke.
MID_SV_Serve_Cle_Mys_m01_02: You're not wrong, but keep it to yourself. We don't\nneed trouble.
MID_SV_Serve_Gat_Ale_m01_01: You're so efficient! No wasted movement. Is that\nthanks to your training?
MID_SV_Serve_Gat_Ale_m01_02: All from what I learned in Sai. I can tell you about it\nlater—over tea, perhaps?
MID_SV_Serve_Gol_Oly_m01_01: You appear to be struggling. By all means, follow\nmy example!
MID_SV_Serve_Gol_Oly_m01_02: I'm not sure how to do that, but...OK!
MID_SV_Serve_Gol_Dan_m01_01: A towering half-giant in a temple... Oh, if only you\ncould start a rampage, tussle with some vulkans...
MID_SV_Serve_Gol_Dan_m01_02: Stop saying stuff like that! I'm not gettin'\nmyself killed!
MID_SV_Serve_Jes_Gol_m01_01: Hey, you got a knack for this! I'm gonna try and\ncopy you.
MID_SV_Serve_Jes_Gol_m01_02: Heh heh HEH! With those hands? Good luck!\nJust watch the master at work.
MID_SV_Serve_Sim_Lil_m01_01: I wasn't really made for places like this. How about\nwe wrap this up quick so we can move on?
MID_SV_Serve_Sim_Lil_m01_02: I'm with you, but if we do a sloppy job, it'll end up\ntaking us longer.
MID_SV_Serve_Sim_Fia_m01_01: That's impressive, Fianna—praying while you work.\nMaybe...you could pray for me while you're at it?
MID_SV_Serve_Sim_Fia_m01_02: W-well of course. Working or not, I promise I will.
MID_SV_Serve_Sci_Sar_m01_01: Miss Sha Lan, please, come to my side! The gentle\nbreeze of my presence shall ease your melancholy.
MID_SV_Serve_Sci_Sar_m01_02: That's kind of you, Sirocco. But I think I'll be fine\non my own.
MID_SV_Serve_Seo_Naz_m01_01: It astonishes me that you can be so garrulous while\nworking. Does your tongue not get tired?
MID_SV_Serve_Seo_Naz_m01_02: It's worse when I try to keep my mouth shut. Try to\nput up with me until we're done, I guess?
MID_SV_Serve_Seo_Lys_m01_01: Try not to look so stricken. Does it pain you so much\nto see me doing service work?
MID_SV_Serve_Seo_Lys_m01_02: I'm your retainer. By rights, whatever Your Majesty\nmust stoop to do ought to fall to me instead.
MID_SV_Serve_Dai_Tro_m01_01: If you're this efficient while on the clock, why can't\nyou apply yourself the rest of the time?
MID_SV_Serve_Dai_Tro_m01_02: Ugh. I do what I feel like. What more do you want\noutta me?
MID_SV_Serve_Tal_Urs_m01_01: Hey, what's a few little cut corners if it makes things\ngo by faster, am I right?
MID_SV_Serve_Tal_Urs_m01_02: There you go spouting nonsense because you're\ngetting bored... Please try to do it properly, Talimun.
MID_SV_Serve_Dit_Esm_m01_01: Sweetie! I'm all done, so now I can help you out.
MID_SV_Serve_Dit_Esm_m01_02: Yes. Let us work together to finish quickly.
MID_SV_Serve_Dit_Hal_m01_01: Serving the gods... I would duel them instead.
MID_SV_Serve_Dit_Hal_m01_02: Eek! No, no, no! You definitely should not try that!
MID_SV_Serve_Die_Nuz_m01_01: It's always a pleasure to see what you achieve when\nwe work together. I'm proud to have you as kin.
MID_SV_Serve_Die_Nuz_m01_02: Alright. But how about you focus on your own work?
MID_SV_Serve_Tob_Sop_m01_01: Grunt work ain't so bad when I remember the bottle\nI have waitin' for me afterward.
MID_SV_Serve_Tob_Sop_m01_02: What a coincidence. That's exactly what I was\nthinking. Gotta have a little fun when work's done!
MID_SV_Serve_Buc_Oly_m01_01: Oh dear, Buccar! That simply will not do. Do you\nwant us to get complaints?
MID_SV_Serve_Buc_Oly_m01_02: Er, really? I should've known I'd be no match for\na priest...
MID_SV_Serve_Buc_Jas_m01_01: Jasmine! We've been entrusted with this task.\nAre you really gonna do such a half-hearted job?
MID_SV_Serve_Buc_Jas_m01_02: How about you stay focused on your own work and\nleave mine be? You wouldn't want to mess things up!
MID_SV_Serve_Hal_Zac_m01_01: I'm worried that if we cut any corners, this temple's\ngod might be mad.
MID_SV_Serve_Hal_Zac_m01_02: Uwah! Mad? You gotta save me from 'em!\nPlease, I'll do anything—even work harder!
MID_SV_Serve_Pet1_Moo1_m01_01: I made some sweets. After we're done with this,\ndo you want to try some?
MID_SV_Serve_Pet1_Moo1_m01_02: Really? Thank you! I better hurry up and finish, then.
MID_SV_Serve_Fab_Tob_m01_01: Tuckered out already, huh? Don't worry, I can work\ntwice as hard to pick up the slack.
MID_SV_Serve_Fab_Tob_m01_02: It is the lot of a beast to bear the burden... As for me,\nI will take my ease.
MID_SV_Serve_Fab_Mic_m01_01: This is a good chance to get some exercise in. You\nneed it. Move that body!
MID_SV_Serve_Fab_Mic_m01_02: I could offer debate, but I suspect there is no point.\nI will do as you suggest.
MID_SV_Serve_Bel_Dan_m01_01: What's your internal monologue right now? Are you\nreflecting on the sanctity of service to others?
MID_SV_Serve_Bel_Dan_m01_02: Let's discuss this later, alright? I can't work and talk\nat the same time.
MID_SV_Serve_Bon_Tob_m01_01: Hmph. I am not entirely familiar with what\nis being asked of me here.
MID_SV_Serve_Bon_Tob_m01_02: Yeah, me neither. But I gotta say, I love seein' you at\na loss for once!
MID_SV_Serve_Lys_Cat_m01_01: Working with me, you can expect sterling quality.\nYou should thank me for it.
MID_SV_Serve_Lys_Cat_m01_02: Er, yes. Thank you very much. Your work is so\nimpeccable that I'm learning a good deal.
MID_SV_Serve_Lou_Ven_m01_01: Generals shouldn't do menial work! You take care\nof it, Ludia. You're young, plenty of energy.
MID_SV_Serve_Lou_Ven_m01_02: But being a general means you ARE a servant to the\npeople. I'll help, but you better pull your weight!
MID_SV_Serve_Led_Guj_m01_01: Let's pass the time with a story—an epic tale from\nmy life! You'll love it.
MID_SV_Serve_Led_Guj_m01_02: Ugh. The last thing I need is more of your boasting.\nShut your mouth and work.
MID_SV_Serve_Led_Buc_m01_01: Milady, do you need a break? Surely you're tired out\nfrom all that work.
MID_SV_Serve_Led_Buc_m01_02: Stop asking me that. I'll be fine—just make me a cup\nof tea when we're done.
MID_SV_Serve_Lor0_Tob_m01_01: Ugggh. Let's get this over with. There's gotta be\nsomething more fun to do!
MID_SV_Serve_Lor0_Tob_m01_02: Sounds good to me. Let's knock this out so you and\nme can go live it up!
MID_SV_Serve_Anh_Dai_m01_01: If you were always this diligent, I wouldn't have to\nnag you half as much.
MID_SV_Serve_Anh_Dai_m01_02: Aww. Are you saying hard work is the way to\nyour heart?
MID_SV_Serve_Orh_Nin_m01_01: We've done so much in service for Credna's\ntemple. I'm sure we'll do this very well!
MID_SV_Serve_Orh_Nin_m01_02: I'm happy to support you too, Orchel. Always\nand forever.
MID_SV_Serve_Max_Hal_m01_01: Hey, Maxim. When we finish up here, would you\nlike to practice some tricks with me?
MID_SV_Serve_Max_Hal_m01_02: Of course! More than happy to. I actually have one in\nmind I've been meaning to show you.
MID_SV_Serve_Ism_m02_01: Our service was perfect.
MID_SV_Serve_Kai0_m02_01: Nice. We did that perfectly.
MID_SV_Serve_Kai1_m02_01: Excellent. A perfect job to the very end.
MID_SV_Serve_Dit_m02_01: Fine enough.
MID_SV_Serve_Seo_m02_01: None can find fault in our work.
MID_SV_Serve_Led_m02_01: Beautiful. I'm happy with that.
MID_SV_Serve_Bel_m02_01: Diligent work always yields results.
MID_SV_Serve_Tal_m02_01: And that, there, is a job well done.
MID_SV_Serve_Orh_m02_01: They should be happy with this!
MID_SV_Serve_Anh_m02_01: That was masterful work.
MID_SV_Serve_Tia0_m02_01: I love seeing the results of hard work.
MID_SV_Serve_Tia1_m02_01: Now I can get back to guilt-free reading.
MID_SV_Serve_Pet0_m02_01: Yes! Perfect!
MID_SV_Serve_Pet1_m02_01: Feels good to get it done right.
MID_SV_Serve_Hur_m02_01: Hehe. A perfect job.
MID_SV_Serve_Max_m02_01: We can feel good about our work today.
MID_SV_Serve_Jes_m02_01: Perfect! Just like my makeup.
MID_SV_Serve_Gol_m02_01: Hey, I didn't screw it up!
MID_SV_Serve_Gat_m02_01: A result even the gods would be proud of.
MID_SV_Serve_Dan_m02_01: An artist always aims for perfection!
MID_SV_Serve_Fab_m02_01: No cause for complaint, I trust.
MID_SV_Serve_Esm_m02_01: Even a god couldn't find fault with this!
MID_SV_Serve_Mic_m02_01: I take my work seriously and do it well.
MID_SV_Serve_Urs_m02_01: I think they'll be rather pleased.
MID_SV_Serve_Sim_m02_01: Some of my best work, I think.
MID_SV_Serve_Lou_m02_01: There you go, hope the god here likes it!
MID_SV_Serve_Fia_m02_01: Always glad to be of service.
MID_SV_Serve_Die_m02_01: Heh. Now they won't have any reason to complain.
MID_SV_Serve_Lor0_m02_01: Good as it gets—pretty sure of that!
MID_SV_Serve_Lor1_m02_01: Alright. Perfect job!
MID_SV_Serve_Set_m02_01: I believe they'll be satisfied with our work.
MID_SV_Serve_Nin_m02_01: You and I have done this to perfection.
MID_SV_Serve_Bon_m02_01: I daresay we achieved perfection here.
MID_SV_Serve_Tob_m02_01: Nailed it!
MID_SV_Serve_Lil_m02_01: Go ahead, try to complain. You can't.
MID_SV_Serve_Lys_m02_01: Perfect by every measure.
MID_SV_Serve_Buc_m02_01: Flawless work.
MID_SV_Serve_Sci_m02_01: Perfection! A work of art, I do say.
MID_SV_Serve_Moo0_m02_01: Wow, turned out great!
MID_SV_Serve_Moo1_m02_01: I think folks will be happy with that!
MID_SV_Serve_Oly_m02_01: A performance to charm even the divine.
MID_SV_Serve_Naz_m02_01: The temple staff has gotta admit we did great.
MID_SV_Serve_Sar_m02_01: They have to accept work this good, right?
MID_SV_Serve_Dai_m02_01: I don't wanna hear any complaints on this one!
MID_SV_Serve_Hal_m02_01: That's perfect any way you slice it.
MID_SV_Serve_Guj_m02_01: That's pretty much how to do it.
MID_SV_Serve_Yan_m02_01: I have done good this day.
MID_SV_Serve_Iio_m02_01: A proper effort for a god.
MID_SV_Serve_Pep_m02_01: A most royal effort!
MID_SV_Serve_Noc_m02_01: Battling, temple work... Whatever it is, I've got it\ncovered.
MID_SV_Serve_Sop_m02_01: Not to toot my own horn, but...not bad!
MID_SV_Serve_Cat_m02_01: Perfection beyond perfection!
MID_SV_Serve_Ned_m02_01: My efforts paid off.
MID_SV_Serve_Zac_m02_01: Good idea, bringin' me in on this!
MID_SV_Serve_Maj_m02_01: This is me we're talking about.
MID_SV_Serve_Ven_m02_01: Hahaha! Perfect, of course!
MID_SV_Serve_Ini_m02_01: My parents would be proud.
MID_SV_Serve_Jas_m02_01: I'd call this done. Wouldn't you?
MID_SV_Serve_Ale_m02_01: If you want results, just ask a temple knight!
MID_SV_Serve_Cle_m02_01: 
MID_SV_Serve_Mys_m02_01: 
MID_SV_Serve_Nat_m02_01: Even the gods could take pride in this.
